        <item>
            <title>Version 3.8</title>
            <sparkle:version>3.8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:34:52 -0600</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in V3.8</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Stays in your menu bar</b> — ClipSave now opens at login by default and reopens itself if macOS stops it. Quit from the menu still keeps it closed until your next login</li>
<li><b>Safe on a full disk</b> — if your Mac runs out of space, ClipSave keeps working, shows a small warning, and saves again as soon as space is free</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>A full disk can no longer corrupt your pinned clips file</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
